Subject: [PATCH] fix(control-room): restore diagnostics SSR boundary

---
 .../diagnostics/DiagnosticsConsole.tsx        | 30 ++++++++-----------
 .../ControlRoomRenderForensicsMarker.tsx      |  9 ++++++
